Acknowledgements
----------------

Nous Research built and maintains hermes-agent. Forge would not exist
without their work. Issues with upstream behavior should be reported to
both the Forge repository and (if reproducible against upstream) the
hermes-agent repository.

If you are using Forge in production, consider whether the upstream
hermes-agent meets your needs — it has a larger community, more
contributors, and faster security response times. Forge's value is in
divergent design choices, not bug fixes that should land upstream.
